Polyfin embeds hls.js's dist/hls.min.js, unmodified, as published on npm
(hls.js@1.6.16), at internal/jellyfin/share/assets/hls.min.js. It serves
it at /share/assets/hls.min.js to the page of share links, which plays
HLS with it in browsers without HLS of their own: nothing is loaded from
elsewhere. jellyfin-web 12.2 ships the same version, but inside its own
build, where no other page can load it.

Source: https://github.com/video-dev/hls.js/tree/v1.6.16
